    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-termĭnātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unbounded</i>, <i>endless</i> (class.): 
